{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "0e960b6a263fd643209d0e21f709f501addfffe0f19cc4709a6a61ff67458349", "ja": "新たな姉妹", "zh": "新的姐妹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "04d3db7a416ed8b3275e37ba1f779ddf1cfac018a5d5f6b17dd7930f933179f3", "ja": "夏祭りで昴を探す千早を見つめていた環は、\nふたりが姉妹として新たな絆を結び直す様子\nを目の当たりにする。傷心の環を慰めたのは\n茜だった。彼女達を見ていた紗代子、可憐、\n麗花は微笑み、その場を後にする。", "zh": "环注视着在夏日祭典上寻找昴的千早，\n亲眼目睹了两人作为姐妹重拾崭新的羁绊。\n安慰伤心的环的人，则是茜。\n注视着她们的纱代子、可怜和丽花\n露出微笑，转身离开了那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "60685963d161a240f79243bb8c85a1a905ff4af1126f8627c8389591670bff6b", "ja": "環ちゃん？\nこんなところで何してるの？", "zh": "小环？\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "018b39bd4c02d9214a7a018beec36bd2306b5fb3c203d18ccfbe187320091302", "ja": "げ、野々原先輩……。", "zh": "糟糕，是野野原前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "75ac72838c90ef9df129c508c4505f59829dfbf572080e0ce45be263b86bbc62", "ja": "茜でいいよー。\nてか、そんな茂みにいたら虫に刺されない？", "zh": "叫我茜就行啦——。\n话说，你待在那种灌木丛里，不会被虫子咬吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "db0e725f6dd67e9f748304661f4103d9a6e191ed8c01d2e62a6da75dad3f842c", "ja": "……。なるほど～。\n千早さんを見てたんだね。", "zh": "……。原来如此～\n你刚才在看千早小姐呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "1af6e12294259608bda61f3c989087cc58a595f541712a26bce6cfca6292fb66", "ja": "先輩には関係ないでしょ……あ。", "zh": "这和前辈没关系吧……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "409f045d491c58a9c31eb08a8e9d98545d2834343b2115c110785431c0e95507", "ja": "！\n永吉さん……。", "zh": "！\n永吉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "9e1023b729404e24cf7866a1753d601dddbb9174cbd92dbebde20732874c9715", "ja": "声、掛けなくていいの？", "zh": "不去打个招呼好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "d8503e3ce2cf33f34435147dc8684cb0a81e78d78a1bed3465126f2e63df42e4", "ja": "……。\n邪魔したいわけじゃないって言ったでしょ。", "zh": "……。\n我都说了，我又不是想去打扰他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "d311c4a22ae548c597a09b556f3a6cb08248bf91587f5e5cea708cfa589eeafa", "ja": "強がっちゃって。\n素直じゃないんだから。", "zh": "明明在逞强。\n真是不坦率呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "f62a3860a9bd7839ee5a54e7b8e8e6953af08c4df79b942db5050b603a06fbbb", "ja": "強がってないもん……。\n……ぐすっ。", "zh": "才没有逞强呢……\n……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "85d2397509530ebb9b452dd1d25520b8554dff861f738c335800c2ceb5b853b6", "ja": "泣いちゃうくらい好きだったんだね、\n千早さんのこと。", "zh": "原来你那么喜欢千早姐姐，都喜欢到哭出来了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "ac9f5049d8d9b56ebcefe8e77cb431b8f73f36a7ff2c203c9cfb7b25afd9d7c8", "ja": "ボクもわかんない……。\n勝手に、涙が出る……。", "zh": "我也不知道……。\n眼泪就自己流出来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "2fa35f964229b49d9e4ea9d2a2cf1bca49f09299f4a470684036d07c5b60f88b", "ja": "しょうがないな～。\n環ちゃんのことは、私がもらってあげるよ。", "zh": "真拿你没办法～。  \n环就交给我来照顾吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "f44b256cb69537895404b24b630fbf714296b0a03c126b66d42137aa6c397709", "ja": "私の妹になれば、毎日が楽しくて楽しくて、\n泣いてる暇なんてなくなっちゃうからね♪", "zh": "要是你当我的妹妹，每天都会开心得不得了，连哭的时间都没有了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "102d3d829d06674b82080cab995fea3f88c346dc7ff45090f19b0181cb722fdc", "ja": "……バカ。", "zh": "……大笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "924ca8f5fcdabcd1bf3e33aa2dc75d99b0222e39469a6d4368e1bc6c329452ef", "ja": "決められたレール通りに行くのも面白くない、か……。\nふふっ、茜らしいかも。", "zh": "……按照既定的轨道前进，也没什么意思吗……\n呵呵，确实很有茜的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "cb3f4eb92401d718bb0295aaa1e8fe0f316693a8a6aa1ca070fe2d1a804bd1e2", "ja": "ミス・ジャスミン。\n妹達のところに行かなくていいの？", "zh": "茉莉小姐。\n不用去妹妹们那边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "b07a1faa1a6f25fcd66b17e477a9117d606e407c04dc52074eb737db9ef4f19f", "ja": "ええ、必要ないと思うわ。\nそう言うミス・デイジーは？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得没必要。\n这么说的黛西小姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "170870832641902bdbe2a406e7701d7d8c60309b30b30c1ddb24d8c54cff323c", "ja": "私もいいわ。\nだって、これからたくさん会えると思うし。", "zh": "我也没关系。因为今后应该还能见到很多次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "2012a1a418bb155bbe04a479dcae30b28b6f7346c5d51f5d357e233be20493c4", "ja": "花火よりもいいものが見れちゃったね。\n次は……私達も、お祭りを楽しみましょう！", "zh": "看到比烟花更棒的东西了呢。\n接下来……我们也一起享受祭典吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_13_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "c9a4613e87d8eb7ecec8b5e0139358f5cc03be0e96b3fee2e14fdc5396f57e45", "ja": "乙女たちの日々は健やかに。こうして聖ミリオン\n女学園に、また新たな姉妹が誕生したのです……。", "zh": "少女们的日子依旧安稳。就这样，圣百万女学园又诞生了新的姐妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
